{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14046","headline":"送归中丞使新罗 · 耿湋","name":"送归中丞使新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"远国通王化，儒林得使臣。\n六君成典册，万里奉丝纶。\n云水连孤棹，恩私在一身。\n悠悠龙节去，渺渺蜃楼新。\n望里行还暮，波中岁又春。\n昏明看日御，灵怪问舟人。\n城邑分华夏，衣裳拟缙绅。\n他时礼命毕，归路勿迷津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14046.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14046","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}